            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>There are a few common reasons why you might be unable to complete your order. First, check that all required fields in your cart are filled out correctly, including your shipping address and payment information. Make sure your payment method is valid and has sufficient funds available.<br/><br/>If you're experiencing technical issues, try clearing your browser cache and cookies, then attempt your purchase again. You can also try using a different browser or device to see if the problem persists.<br/><br/>If you've tried these steps and still can't place an order, please contact our customer support team. We're here to help and can troubleshoot the issue with you directly.</p>",
