            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Orders may be cancelled for several reasons, including payment verification issues, inventory unavailability, or address validation problems. We review each cancellation carefully. If your order was cancelled, you'll receive an email with the specific reason and next steps. Please check your inbox and spam folder, or contact our support team with your order number for immediate assistance.</p>",
